+The graph reduction uses only exact original `literalRetainedBytes` and the
+original seal capacity stored in that slot birth, plus old escaped extent and
+the newly booked temporary construction work. It does not reduce arbitrary
+decoder credit, permanent Root/work/HTTP fields or unrelated domains.
+
+## Finite conservative bounds
